        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DoralLock 810871, Montego Single Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFeaturing a 5-pin cylinder this handleset has an ANSI grade 2 security rating. It is not only functional, it is beautiful. The oval mounts of this DoralLock made single cylinder entry set paired with the delicate curved handle will not disappoint those looking for a classic that can withstand the ever changing fashions of today's world with undeniable elegance. The Montego Single Cylinder Handleset comes with your choice of inside handle style. It has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\". Single cylinder handlesets has a thumbpiece on the outside and a turnknob on the inside. The key on the handleset is operated by a thumbturn on the inside knob. The deadbolt is key operated on the outside while the inside is operated by a thumbpiece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> the latchbolt is operated by a thumbpiece outside and grip inside. The deadbolt is operated by a key outside and a thumbturn inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: matching <a href=\"/products/montego-dummy-handleset-dorallock-810871d\">Montego Dummy Handleset</a> for the inactive side of double doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Single Cylinder Montego Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits a standard 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI grade 2 security.</li>\r\n<li>5 pin keyway that is Kwikset compatible.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Oval Montego Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 11-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Height center to center: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Plate Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Plate Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Top Plate Height: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bottom Plate Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable from 2-3/8\" to 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-810871-specifications.pdf?v=1704262174\" target=\"new\"><b>DoralLock Montego Single Cylinder Handleset Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/door-handing-picture.gif?v=1704352978\" border=\"0\" width=\"410\" height=\"150\" alt=\"door handing - left or right handed lever\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim finish will match the exterior handleset finish that you choose.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Single Cylinder Montego Handleset, DoralLock 810871",
                "description": "810871 DoralLock Montego Handleset Keyed Entry- \r\nThe Montego Handleset comes with an adjustable backset from 2 3/8 to 2 3/4\r\n\r\nThe Montego Handleset is made of solid brass and plated in your choice of 7 finishes that are highly resistant to tarnishing. 8 different knobs/levers are available for inside trim. \r\n",
                "keywords": "810871, DoralLock Montego keyed entry Handleset, dorallock Handlesets, brass handlesets, handle for the front door, 810871 dorallock single cylinder hanover handlesets, dor-810871, dor-810871, single cylinder handlesets, traditional handlesets, classic handlesets, oval handlesets, Montego handlesets, Single Cylinder Montego Handlesets,"
            },
